{"version":1,"content":"<p>據央視新聞，11月14日，我國自主研製的10噸級電動商用飛機CE-25A在山東濱州<strong>完成首次有人駕駛智能飛行</strong>。這是繼CE-25A今年2月2日無人駕駛智能首飛之後，該機研製的又一裏程碑。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586378.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T07:21:27.171973+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":98,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T06:56:27+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T07:14:40.549004+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T07:14:40.549004+00:00","content_hash":"e9afbcbde52079fa4589f4d6a6553564091e901a91f1a3f204f7e0a0efd87b36","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}